  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Home Highlights<br>- Gulf-front w/ direct beach access<br>- Private Pool (Heating available for an additional $30 per day during the months of Oct 1-May 1)<br>- Complimentary beach setups each morning include 2 beach chairs and 1 umbrella <br>- Outdoor kitchen<br>- Firepit<br>- 6 adult bikes provided<br><br>Set along the pristine quartz sands and turquoise waters of Seacrest Beach, this Gulf-front retreat offers an unforgettable coastal escape. With 5 bedrooms and 5.5 bathrooms between the Main House and Carriage House, the property accommodates up to 16 guests. Enjoy sweeping Gulf views, relaxing by the private pool, gathering around the firepit at sunset, and reaching the beach with just a one-minute walk.<br>The three-level home blends modern comforts with Cape Dutch inspired architecture. On the ground floor, a heated Gulf-front pool, built-in grill, and wet bar create a laid-back outdoor living space. Inside, a media room with its own wet bar sets the stage for easy entertainment.<br>Take the stairs or elevator to the second level, where expansive Gulf views fill the open living and dining areas. The gourmet kitchen features a Sub-Zero double fridge, two dishwashers, a 6-burner Wolf range, and seating for four at the island. Foldaway glass doors open to a furnished balcony, perfect for morning coffee. This level also offers a bonus room with a kitchenette and a laundry room with two stacked washer–dryer sets.<br>The top-floor primary suite includes a king bed, private bath, and a spacious balcony with panoramic. A gas firepit and wet bar add extra comfort.<br>The attached Carriage House provides added privacy with a king suite on the first floor and a queen bedroom plus a bunk room with two twin-over-twin bunks on the second.<br>This property delivers an exceptional Seacrest Beach stay. With parking for three vehicles, six complimentary adult bikes, and convenient community beach access at the end of the street, exploring the area is effortless. <br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br><br>First Floor<br>King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>Bunk Area – Twin over Twin, Jr Twin over Jr Twin w/ Shared bathroom, Shower/Tub Combo<br><br>Third Floor<br>Master King Bedroom, Private Bathroom w/ Shower/Tub Separate<br><br>Carriage House<br>First Floor<br>King Bedroom, Private Bathroom w/ Shower Only<br><br>Second Floor<br>Queen Bedroom, Shared Bathroom w/ Shower/Tub Combo<br>Two Twin over Twin Bunkroom",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Gulf Royale 30A| Easy Beach Access|Private Pool|Gated Community"
        }
      ],
