            "response": "Thank you for your thoughtful review! We’re so glad you enjoyed the home and found everything you needed for a perfect beach week. The gas line for the pool heat has since been repaired, and we’re happy the issue was resolved quickly. We can’t wait to welcome you back!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
