        ],
        "text": "To say this property was extraordinary is almost an understatement. The house is beautiful and offers everything we could possibly need for a week at the beach. The property management team was wonderful to work with. We weren't able to enjoy the pool because of a gas line issue, but it seemed to be a one-off, not a recurring issue with the property. Once they realized that the pool heating fee was refunded immediately. We will definately be back!",
